# Everything not needed to compile the CLI. Keeping build output out matters
# beyond speed: a stale bin/ or obj/ from the host (a different OS and RID) would
# otherwise be copied in and confuse restore.
**/bin/
**/obj/
artifacts/
tests/
.git
.github/
.githooks/
.claude/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
**/TestResults/
.env
